1
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:17,770
[Certificate of Honor]

2
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:31,880
Help.

3
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:36,520
Are you all sober now?

4
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:38,840
Then I'll say a few words.

5
00:00:38,960 --> 00:00:41,000
We had a great vibe drinking yesterday.

6
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,200
Everyone was happy,

7
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:43,600
and we had a lot of fun.

8
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:44,840
But when it comes to drinking,

9
00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:45,900
moderation is key.

10
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:48,320
Let's not drink like this again.

11
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:49,440
Don't even mention it.

12
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:50,120
Last night,

13
00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:52,400
Wanwan and I both slept on the rug by the door.

14
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:54,640
We only went inside after waking up from the cold.

15
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:56,200
My head is still spinning.

16
00:00:56,200 --> 00:00:58,360
I wasn't paying attention when I got home yesterday.

17
00:00:58,360 --> 00:01:00,600
Eason and the washing machine spun all night.

18
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:02,480
After I put you to bed yesterday,

19
00:01:02,480 --> 00:01:04,010
I can't remember anything.

20
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,000
Don't mention it.

21
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:06,240
When I was putting on makeup this morning,

22
00:01:06,240 --> 00:01:07,800
I couldn't even find my eyelashes.

23
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:09,840
How did I get home?

24
00:01:09,840 --> 00:01:11,240
Why can't I remember anything?

25
00:01:11,240 --> 00:01:13,480
Sister Hu and I sent you back one by one.

26
00:01:14,840 --> 00:01:15,440
Thank you, Wu.

27
00:01:15,440 --> 00:01:16,440
All right.

28
00:01:16,440 --> 00:01:17,240
Thank you, Wu.

29
00:01:17,720 --> 00:01:19,760
Let me tell you two things.

30
00:01:19,760 --> 00:01:20,690
The good news is,

31
00:01:21,039 --> 00:01:23,440
we want to congratulate this happy couple.

32
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:26,160
A perfect match.

33
00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:28,000
A match made in heaven.

34
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:29,240
The bad news is,

35
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:30,560
Mr. Shen

36
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:32,600
is pulling his investment.

37
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:34,800
Wasn't Mr. Shen satisfied with our performance?

38
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:36,440
Why is he talking about withdrawing his investment again?

39
00:01:36,440 --> 00:01:37,759
I heard from Lao Wu that

40
00:01:37,759 --> 00:01:40,560
Mr. Shen thinks our play is too traditional.

41
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:42,560
He said the market won't accept it,

42
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:43,600
and the audience won't like it.

43
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:46,000
But we can't delay our rehearsal progress.

44
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,780
Is there still time to find other investors now?

45
00:01:49,360 --> 00:01:51,220
Probably not in such a short time.

46
00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:55,000
Lao Wu said he would talk to Mr. Shen again.

47
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:56,450
Who knows how it will go.

48
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:58,240
What do we do now?

49
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:00,300
Just wait here doing nothing?

50
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:02,260
We can't just wait around.

51
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:03,900
I thought about it.

52
00:02:03,960 --> 00:02:04,960
Our play here

53
00:02:05,440 --> 00:02:06,500
needs to innovate.

54
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:07,360
Before,

55
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:08,759
it was too rigid,

56
00:02:08,759 --> 00:02:09,600
too serious,

57
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:11,120
and too inflexible.

58
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:13,160
Art comes from life

59
00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:13,760
and rises above it,

60
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:15,620
but it also needs to reflect life.

61
00:02:16,160 --> 00:02:16,680
We...

62
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:19,760
Ning Jin,

63
00:02:19,760 --> 00:02:21,220
I'm not talking about you.

64
00:02:29,160 --> 00:02:31,090
Do you all think the same as Boss Wu?

65
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:44,280
Sister.

66
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:46,800
I've been looking for you.

67
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:47,760
Here you are.

68
00:02:49,480 --> 00:02:49,940
Sister,

69
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:51,800
can I talk to you for a moment?

70
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:52,680
I'm busy.

71
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:56,200
Sister,

72
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:58,440
you can hit me,

73
00:02:58,840 --> 00:02:59,770
you can scold me,

74
00:03:00,440 --> 00:03:01,770
but you can't ignore me.

75
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:05,000
Sister,

76
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:07,420
we've known each other for ten years.

77
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:09,820
You still remember

78
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:12,060
we've known each other for ten years?

79
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:15,120
Ever since you watched our showcase last time

80
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:17,440
and pointed out that the play was too traditional,

81
00:03:17,440 --> 00:03:17,760
I...

82
00:03:17,760 --> 00:03:20,400
we revamped the whole thing.

83
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:21,700
Sister.

84
00:03:21,720 --> 00:03:22,480
Look at you.

85
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:23,940
You're still ignoring me.

86
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:25,640
I must have offended you somehow.

87
00:03:25,640 --> 00:03:26,720
How about this.

88
00:03:28,040 --> 00:03:29,370
I'll take a shot myself.

89
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:29,800
Here.

90
00:03:39,200 --> 00:03:39,840
Sister.

91
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:43,360
You are the flare in my dark night.

92
00:03:43,920 --> 00:03:46,120
You are the compass for my progress.

93
00:03:46,640 --> 00:03:47,300
Your words,

94
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:48,480
golden advice,

95
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:50,160
are like an imperial decree.

96
00:03:50,160 --> 00:03:51,600
Really?

97
00:03:51,600 --> 00:03:53,200
My words are an imperial decree?

98
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:54,360
Absolutely.

99
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:55,920
Sister, I'm here for you.

100
00:03:55,920 --> 00:03:56,520
Come, sit.

101
00:03:57,160 --> 00:03:58,020
How about this?

102
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:58,970
Finish this,

103
00:03:59,480 --> 00:04:00,810
and we'll keep talking.

104
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:03,200
Is it too hard?

105
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:04,040
Not at all.

106
00:04:08,920 --> 00:04:09,640
I'm busy.

107
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:11,040
Then go, I won't keep you.

108
00:04:11,040 --> 00:04:11,800
Wait.

109
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:12,800
This...

110
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:14,060
No one can tear me away.

111
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:15,650
I have to finish this today.

112
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:18,120
Bottoms up.

113
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:18,480
Good.

114
00:04:19,399 --> 00:04:20,480
Good.

115
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:26,360
Come on.

116
00:04:26,960 --> 00:04:27,800
Stretch.

117
00:04:28,200 --> 00:04:29,530
That's an improvement.

118
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:31,720
Up.

119
00:04:32,080 --> 00:04:32,800
Slowly.

120
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:35,800
Did Ms. Shen say when she would come?

121
00:04:37,240 --> 00:04:38,440
Ms. Shen is busy.

122
00:04:38,840 --> 00:04:40,500
She told us to rehearse first.

123
00:04:42,400 --> 00:04:44,330
Did you show her our new direction?

124
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:48,159
She highly approves of it.

125
00:04:48,840 --> 00:04:49,900
As for the funding,

126
00:04:50,280 --> 00:04:51,159
don't worry.

127
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:52,840
When I'm done with this busy period,

128
00:04:52,840 --> 00:04:53,840
I'll go visit her.

129
00:04:54,840 --> 00:04:55,560
Really?

130
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:57,000
Nothing else?

131
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:59,760
Don't just report the good news and hide the bad.

132
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:00,760
Turn to your side.

133
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:05,000
Qingsong choreographed this well.

134
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:05,480
Look at

135
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:06,600
this move.

136
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:07,460
I'm asking you.

137
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:10,120
What else could there be?

138
00:05:10,960 --> 00:05:13,120
Ms. Shen has a ton of projects on hand.

139
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:16,060
Just because you tweaked a character

140
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:17,080
and adjusted the plot,

141
00:05:17,080 --> 00:05:19,800
she shouldn't have to worry about such trivial matters.

142
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:21,640
Then what does she mean by dragging it out like this?

143
00:05:21,640 --> 00:05:23,560
I have all these actors and staff,

144
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:25,090
and they all have expenses.

145
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:27,240
Jin Xi bought the box lunches these two days.

146
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:28,770
Heying ordered the coffee.

147
00:05:29,440 --> 00:05:30,800
Even Qingsong's tolls

148
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:32,530
were paid out of his own pocket.

149
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,240
Okay,

150
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:35,300
my great director.

151
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,130
As for the expenses,

152
00:05:37,440 --> 00:05:38,400
I'll keep an eye on them for now.

153
00:05:38,400 --> 00:05:41,080
Just stay here and rehearse.

154
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:42,560
As for the money,

155
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:44,240
I'll resolve it as soon as possible.

156
00:05:44,240 --> 00:05:45,840
Don't let these trivial matters

157
00:05:45,840 --> 00:05:48,320
affect your creative state.

158
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:50,440
Okay, breathe.

159
00:05:51,200 --> 00:05:52,360
Keep your breathing steady.

160
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:52,800
Pay attention to the rhythm.

161
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:53,440
Relax.

162
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:55,640
Take it easy.

163
00:05:55,880 --> 00:05:56,340
Call me.

164
00:05:57,200 --> 00:05:57,840
No.

165
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:11,880
Oh my.

166
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,440
Two of Cups reversed.

167
00:06:16,440 --> 00:06:17,700
Have you recently felt

168
00:06:18,200 --> 00:06:20,200
like your life has lost its balance,

169
00:06:21,240 --> 00:06:22,960
making you feel uneasy?

170
00:06:25,320 --> 00:06:25,760
Look.

171
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:30,560
Then what's the source of my anxiety?

172
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:33,440
The Hanged Man

173
00:06:33,440 --> 00:06:34,120
upright.

174
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:37,400
It's an uninvited guest.

175
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:38,600
Their appearance

176
00:06:39,040 --> 00:06:41,240
has been messing with your mind

177
00:06:41,320 --> 00:06:43,380
and interfering with your judgment.

178
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:48,440
Is it a man or a woman?

179
00:06:48,440 --> 00:06:49,080
A woman.

180
00:06:50,320 --> 00:06:51,960
A woman.

181
00:06:55,440 --> 00:06:56,360
Shen.

182
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:58,560
I misread it.

183
00:06:58,560 --> 00:07:00,360
This uninvited guest is a man.

184
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:02,900
Take a look.

185
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:10,160
Let's talk about Western metaphysics later.

186
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:12,160
Let's chat about Eastern art first.

187
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:16,360
You wouldn't be here unless you needed something.

188
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:20,240
You see that I only visit when I need something,

189
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:24,800
but did you miss how I keep you in my heart every day?

190
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:29,240
Vicky, why don't you go rest over there?

191
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,640
We need to talk business.

192
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:32,810
We'll continue the reading later.

193
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:33,440
Okay.

194
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:36,640
Jie.

195
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:40,920
Don't mess up my cards.

196
00:07:41,760 --> 00:07:42,290
Go ahead.

197
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:45,600
It's about our play 'A Chinese Ghost Story'.

198
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:46,840
Do you have time?

199
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:52,320
For what?

200
00:07:52,320 --> 00:07:52,880
Jie,

201
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:56,120
we always welcome your guidance.

202
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:57,760
You can raise issues anytime,

203
00:07:57,760 --> 00:07:59,620
and we will fix them immediately.

204
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:05,360
Can you stop dragging your feet?

205
00:08:07,200 --> 00:08:11,000
Our entire theater troupe is counting on you to put food on the table.

206
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:13,600
You have a heart of gold.

207
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:15,380
Please,

208
00:08:15,840 --> 00:08:17,370
don't leave us in the lurch.

209
00:08:17,440 --> 00:08:18,000
Look,

210
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:19,320
how sincere I am.

211
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:20,480
Right?

212
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:21,840
Sincere?

213
00:08:21,840 --> 00:08:22,400
Yes.

214
00:08:22,400 --> 00:08:25,360
You agreed to drink a whole tower,

215
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:26,820
but you only drank the tip.

216
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:28,300
You pretended to be drunk.

217
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:29,440
How much sincerity is that?

218
00:08:29,440 --> 00:08:30,400
Only this much.

219
00:08:32,559 --> 00:08:35,360
I just wasn't in good form that day.

220
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:38,169
Do you have something on your mind?

221
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:41,530
Are you seeing someone?

222
00:08:42,039 --> 00:08:43,640
Who was on the phone with you?

223
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,320
That's our Xiaohu.

224
00:08:48,040 --> 00:08:50,280
Little Huzi.

225
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:52,240
Your girlfriend?

226
00:08:54,680 --> 00:08:55,680
Girlfriend.

227
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,880
But don't worry, Sister.

228
00:09:00,160 --> 00:09:01,440
Our Xiaohu

229
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:03,560
will definitely support me.

230
00:09:03,560 --> 00:09:04,840
She would even urge me

231
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:07,560
to take good care of Sister Shen first.

232
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:09,880
She's that generous?

233
00:09:12,040 --> 00:09:13,170
You two are so close,

234
00:09:13,400 --> 00:09:14,440
so committed.

235
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:15,560
Right?

236
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:19,040
Meeting her at my age

237
00:09:19,040 --> 00:09:19,720
is actually

238
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:21,440
quite a blessing.

239
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:24,160
I, Shen Shufang,

240
00:09:24,160 --> 00:09:26,160
hate sharing my things with others.

241
00:09:26,920 --> 00:09:29,160
Even if I don't like it.

242
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:32,600
Even if I don't need it.

243
00:09:34,920 --> 00:09:35,720
Sister...

244
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:37,640
You can't spend my money

245
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:41,000
and expect me to watch you keep another woman company.

246
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:41,880
I would never

247
00:09:41,880 --> 00:09:43,560
make such a losing deal.

248
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:45,000
Sister,

249
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:45,680
I...

250
00:09:45,760 --> 00:09:46,800
but...

251
00:09:47,840 --> 00:09:51,040
What I hate hearing most is 'but.'

252
00:09:53,560 --> 00:09:54,440
The money

253
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:56,760
can be provided anytime.

254
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:59,560
As long as you break up with that woman.

255
00:09:59,560 --> 00:10:00,960
Break it off completely.

256
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:05,440
On one side is the troupe.

257
00:10:07,920 --> 00:10:09,960
On the other is a woman.

258
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:13,000
Choose for yourself.

259
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:16,360
Sister.

260
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:16,840
Coming.

261
00:10:26,040 --> 00:10:28,170
Why aren't you eating the boxed lunch?

262
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:34,180
The leftover bread from this morning

263
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:35,240
tastes good.

264
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:43,160
Is it because the theater troupe's expenses are too high lately

265
00:10:43,160 --> 00:10:45,290
so you want to save as much as possible?

266
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:47,130
What are you talking about?

267
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:49,890
I just think the boxed lunch is too greasy.

268
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:52,040
We middle-aged people have to

269
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:54,720
always maintain our figures.

270
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:01,500
Delicious.

271
00:11:06,640 --> 00:11:07,560
Here.

272
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:09,240
Drink some water.

273
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:12,080
Slow down.

274
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:20,800
Tell me the truth.

275
00:11:21,560 --> 00:11:23,290
Is it over with President Shen?

276
00:11:24,160 --> 00:11:25,820
No, what are you guessing for?

277
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:27,810
Then what does she mean?

278
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:29,160
Dragging it out for so long.

279
00:11:29,160 --> 00:11:29,760
She isn't coming,

280
00:11:29,760 --> 00:11:30,360
and the money isn't coming either.

281
00:11:30,360 --> 00:11:31,440
Can you keep your voice down?

282
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:32,170
Keep it down.

283
00:11:32,440 --> 00:11:33,900
So all the actors hear you?

284
00:11:35,120 --> 00:11:35,980
Let me tell you.

285
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:37,850
You're disturbing the morale.

286
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:38,290
Fine.

287
00:11:38,680 --> 00:11:40,410
Don't sit here with me anymore.

288
00:11:41,360 --> 00:11:43,020
Remember to finish your meal.

289
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:48,680
Little Wu.

290
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:56,160
What's wrong?

291
00:11:57,240 --> 00:11:58,370
Are you in a bad mood?

292
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:00,930
Didn't get the money from Ms. Shen?

293
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:03,640
So what if I didn't?

294
00:12:03,800 --> 00:12:04,840
If she doesn't give it to me,

295
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:05,640
will you?

296
00:12:06,560 --> 00:12:07,400
Wu Qiming,

297
00:12:07,800 --> 00:12:09,330
what's with that attitude?

298
00:12:09,480 --> 00:12:10,880
I don't owe you anything.

299
00:12:11,400 --> 00:12:12,720
I didn't say you owe me.

300
00:12:13,320 --> 00:12:14,480
I just want to say,

301
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:16,680
mind your own business from now on.

302
00:12:19,280 --> 00:12:20,680
You think I care too much?

303
00:12:21,320 --> 00:12:22,760
Then I won't care anymore.

304
00:12:22,760 --> 00:12:23,880
That's for the best.

305
00:12:23,880 --> 00:12:24,440
Fine.

306
00:12:24,640 --> 00:12:25,680
Don't regret it.

307
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:31,440
What's wrong now?

308
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:33,450
Why are you so angry?

309
00:12:37,080 --> 00:12:37,840
What

310
00:12:38,200 --> 00:12:39,260
are you looking at?

311
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:41,780
Haven't you seen an adult break down before?

312
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:06,400
Why haven't you left yet?

313
00:13:06,400 --> 00:13:07,800
You haven't left either.

314
00:13:09,680 --> 00:13:11,340
I made some herbal tea for you.

315
00:13:11,640 --> 00:13:13,300
It's good for staying up late.

316
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:22,600
Thank you.

317
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:28,000
How did you know I stayed up late?

318
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:30,330
You have dark circles under your eyes.

319
00:13:48,600 --> 00:13:49,880
I did stay up late.

320
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:53,720
But I still have to thank you.

321
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:55,560
Thank me?

322
00:13:59,280 --> 00:14:00,120
Yesterday,

323
00:14:00,680 --> 00:14:03,480
I fell asleep watching your 'Huayue Zhuan' video.

324
00:14:04,280 --> 00:14:06,210
You can fall asleep watching that?

325
00:14:08,680 --> 00:14:10,140
Because I wanted to say...

326
00:14:10,680 --> 00:14:12,200
So many people insult you,

327
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:14,660
yet you remain so optimistic.

328
00:14:15,400 --> 00:14:17,060
So what does my little setback

329
00:14:18,080 --> 00:14:19,120
amount to?

330
00:14:35,080 --> 00:14:37,280
Let these insults and attacks

331
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:39,360
fall like rain.

332
00:14:40,920 --> 00:14:42,280
And in this rain,

333
00:14:42,960 --> 00:14:44,080
I will tap dance.

334
00:14:47,480 --> 00:14:48,880
Aren't these my lyrics?

335
00:14:51,680 --> 00:14:53,010
You listened to my song.

336
00:14:59,680 --> 00:15:00,480
Jinxi.

337
00:15:02,600 --> 00:15:03,440
This time,

338
00:15:05,680 --> 00:15:07,480
I hope to be like you

339
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:09,080
and be my true self.

340
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:31,660
Where is Wu Qiming?

341
00:15:32,040 --> 00:15:32,900
I'll go get him.

342
00:15:40,320 --> 00:15:41,120
Sister.

343
00:15:43,800 --> 00:15:44,560
These are

344
00:15:46,120 --> 00:15:47,720
all the dishes I made for you.

345
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:52,840
I personally went to the kitchen

346
00:15:54,400 --> 00:15:55,480
to cook them.

347
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:56,240
Come on.

348
00:15:59,200 --> 00:15:59,920
This is

349
00:16:00,240 --> 00:16:01,760
Japanese black cod.

350
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:05,800
I know you don't like white sesame,

351
00:16:05,840 --> 00:16:08,400
so I specifically added orange zest.

352
00:16:08,480 --> 00:16:10,320
I wonder if you like this flavor.

353
00:16:11,120 --> 00:16:13,720
You really know what I like to eat.

354
00:16:14,120 --> 00:16:15,560
My chef at home

355
00:16:15,680 --> 00:16:17,000
has been with me for three years,

356
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:18,460
and he still doesn't know.

357
00:16:18,920 --> 00:16:20,800
But I am a nostalgic person.

358
00:16:21,080 --> 00:16:22,480
As long as they are willing to change,

359
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:24,340
even if they make a mistake or two,

360
00:16:24,880 --> 00:16:26,610
I will always keep them around.

361
00:16:29,960 --> 00:16:31,020
Thank you, Sister,

362
00:16:31,600 --> 00:16:33,640
for your care and appreciation.

363
00:16:34,680 --> 00:16:35,740
I don't deserve it.

364
00:16:37,920 --> 00:16:38,760
This is

365
00:16:39,680 --> 00:16:41,480
the last time I will cook for you.

366
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:43,720
What do you mean?

367
00:16:46,480 --> 00:16:47,720
At the end of the day,

368
00:16:48,600 --> 00:16:50,400
it's not a problem with the work.

369
00:16:51,920 --> 00:16:54,580
So that's why you decided to go with Sister Hu...

370
00:16:54,800 --> 00:16:56,000
I would never do that.

371
00:16:59,480 --> 00:17:00,600
I've let you down.

372
00:17:02,680 --> 00:17:04,200
As for Mr. Shen's money,

373
00:17:05,599 --> 00:17:07,000
I really can't secure it.

374
00:17:07,560 --> 00:17:09,220
The project can be put on hold.

375
00:17:09,319 --> 00:17:11,450
I can go with you to find new investors.

376
00:17:11,920 --> 00:17:14,650
I can handle the presentations and socializing.

377
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:16,839
Don't stop the project.

378
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:18,280
As for the money,

379
00:17:19,119 --> 00:17:20,650
I'll figure something out.

380
00:17:25,280 --> 00:17:26,319
Over the years,

381
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:28,780
you have invested a lot of money in me.

382
00:17:28,920 --> 00:17:29,640
And I

383
00:17:30,360 --> 00:17:31,890
have helped you make money.

384
00:17:32,440 --> 00:17:33,680
My choice this time is

385
00:17:35,920 --> 00:17:36,920
not to cooperate.

386
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:39,940
Thank you, sister.

387
00:17:58,120 --> 00:18:01,040
Wu Qiming, you are nothing without me.

388
00:18:09,080 --> 00:18:09,720
Get out.

389
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:25,560
This seems to be my office.

390
00:18:50,120 --> 00:18:50,920
Niu.

391
00:18:52,800 --> 00:18:53,800
Huniu.

392
00:18:55,680 --> 00:18:57,080
Please don't be mad at me.

393
00:18:57,640 --> 00:18:59,500
You can even beat me up if you want.

394
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:11,880
I've just been stressed out because Sister Shen withdrew her investment.

395
00:19:11,880 --> 00:19:12,440
You...

396
00:19:12,760 --> 00:19:14,200
Can't you understand me?

397
00:19:15,200 --> 00:19:17,130
Is the investment issue resolved?

398
00:19:17,440 --> 00:19:19,370
President Shen has many projects.

399
00:19:19,680 --> 00:19:20,920
She won't miss mine.

400
00:19:21,800 --> 00:19:24,080
How about I go see her with you again,

401
00:19:24,480 --> 00:19:27,000
and let her know about Jinxi's box office appeal?

402
00:19:27,000 --> 00:19:27,480
Don't.

403
00:19:29,200 --> 00:19:30,560
It's not about Jinxi.

404
00:19:30,560 --> 00:19:33,120
Then what is it?

405
00:19:33,120 --> 00:19:34,200
What is it?

406
00:19:34,200 --> 00:19:38,400
President Shen wants to change the script.

407
00:19:38,440 --> 00:19:43,440
She insists on putting Nie Xiaoqian and the Old Demon of Black Mountain together.

408
00:19:43,840 --> 00:19:44,960
On their wedding day,

409
00:19:44,960 --> 00:19:46,240
she kills her husband,

410
00:19:46,480 --> 00:19:49,080
and Grandma becomes a legendary enchantress.

411
00:19:49,080 --> 00:19:50,740
A strong female revenge lead?

412
00:19:51,240 --> 00:19:52,700
How is that even possible?

413
00:19:52,920 --> 00:19:53,680
Exactly!

414
00:19:53,680 --> 00:19:55,000
I'd be the first to refuse.

415
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:56,660
Even if you agree, I wouldn't.

416
00:19:57,560 --> 00:19:58,320
You get me.

417
00:20:12,080 --> 00:20:14,840
Why do I feel like after President Shen withdrew her investment,

418
00:20:14,840 --> 00:20:16,500
you're actually quite happy?

419
00:20:16,680 --> 00:20:18,120
We're artists.

420
00:20:18,600 --> 00:20:20,920
We can't bow to capital.

421
00:20:34,320 --> 00:20:35,320
Mr. Shen

422
00:20:37,120 --> 00:20:39,240
decided not to invest.

423
00:20:42,680 --> 00:20:43,480
Sister Hu.

424
00:20:44,320 --> 00:20:46,680
Jin Xi, I've told you many times.

425
00:20:46,680 --> 00:20:49,040
We can't be both the male lead

426
00:20:49,040 --> 00:20:50,840
and the investor of this play.

427
00:20:50,920 --> 00:20:53,680
We can't control the public opinion this way.

428
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:55,160
Then what should we do?

429
00:20:55,160 --> 00:20:55,880
Right.

430
00:20:59,680 --> 00:21:01,880
I think increasing income is one thing,

431
00:21:02,320 --> 00:21:03,720
we can also reduce expenditure.

432
00:21:03,720 --> 00:21:05,980
Bring your own meals starting tomorrow.

433
00:21:06,560 --> 00:21:07,480
Smart, baby.

434
00:21:07,920 --> 00:21:09,800
We don't need coffee and drinks anymore.

435
00:21:09,800 --> 00:21:11,120
We'll bring our own cups from now on.

436
00:21:11,120 --> 00:21:11,600
Healthy.

437
00:21:11,600 --> 00:21:12,040
Right.

438
00:21:12,040 --> 00:21:13,280
We can also save on taxi fares.

439
00:21:13,280 --> 00:21:14,400
I can give a ride to

440
00:21:14,400 --> 00:21:16,400
one, two, three, four, five people.

441
00:21:16,920 --> 00:21:18,480
We can split the gas money.

442
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:20,800
I print scripts on the back of old paper.

443
00:21:20,800 --> 00:21:22,120
It saves a lot of money.

444
00:21:22,120 --> 00:21:24,600
I can carry the water back from the station.

445
00:21:24,600 --> 00:21:25,320
I'm strong.

446
00:21:29,120 --> 00:21:30,450
Everyone, go rehearse.

447
00:21:30,640 --> 00:21:31,200
Okay.

448
00:21:36,600 --> 00:21:37,920
How's it going with your contacts?

449
00:21:37,920 --> 00:21:39,120
I'm asking right now.

450
00:21:52,920 --> 00:21:55,640
Who are you two looking for?

451
00:21:55,640 --> 00:21:56,480
Excuse me.

452
00:21:57,320 --> 00:21:58,000
Sorry to bother you,

453
00:21:58,000 --> 00:22:00,060
but I need to take up some of your time.

454
00:22:03,080 --> 00:22:05,680
I'm looking for the general director of the Xiyin Troupe,

455
00:22:05,680 --> 00:22:06,840
Mr. Wu Qiming.

456
00:22:09,480 --> 00:22:10,740
You're looking for me?

457
00:22:12,120 --> 00:22:13,720
Aren't you Jin Xi's partner?

458
00:22:14,320 --> 00:22:14,880
Don't worry.

459
00:22:14,880 --> 00:22:16,010
I'm not a bad person.

460
00:22:18,040 --> 00:22:19,480
He is Jinxi's toxic solo fan.

461
00:22:19,480 --> 00:22:20,680
Don't think I've forgotten about you.

462
00:22:20,680 --> 00:22:22,040
He is a fan of Jinxi.

463
00:22:23,000 --> 00:22:23,930
You're here too.

464
00:22:25,280 --> 00:22:27,600
Um, fans are not allowed in here.

465
00:22:28,920 --> 00:22:30,120
Let me introduce him.

466
00:22:30,120 --> 00:22:31,160
This is our Hengshu Group's

467
00:22:31,160 --> 00:22:32,480
CEO, Mr. Leng Yiheng.

468
00:22:40,040 --> 00:22:42,000
Hengshu Group was founded in 2000.

469
00:22:42,040 --> 00:22:43,600
In nearly 10 years,

470
00:22:43,600 --> 00:22:45,120
it grew from a 2,000 yuan workshop

471
00:22:45,120 --> 00:22:45,960
into its current state as

472
00:22:45,960 --> 00:22:48,320
an international corporation focusing on daily necessities.

473
00:22:48,320 --> 00:22:49,880
On January 22, 2010,

474
00:22:49,880 --> 00:22:51,720
it was successfully listed on the Shenzhen Stock Exchange.

475
00:22:51,720 --> 00:22:53,560
Its current business involves Hengshu Cultural Tourism.

476
00:22:53,560 --> 00:22:55,890
Hengshu Technology, Hengshu Daily, etc.

477
00:22:56,840 --> 00:22:58,640
This is our group's chairman,

478
00:22:58,640 --> 00:22:59,680
Mr. Leng Qingqiu.

479
00:23:00,680 --> 00:23:01,680
And this is

480
00:23:01,880 --> 00:23:02,640
our group's CEO,

481
00:23:02,640 --> 00:23:03,920
Mr. Leng Yiheng.

482
00:23:05,480 --> 00:23:08,280
Next, let me explain the international division.

483
00:23:08,680 --> 00:23:09,560
Excuse me,

484
00:23:10,440 --> 00:23:11,760
what are you doing?

485
00:23:12,280 --> 00:23:13,440
We are rehearsing right now.

486
00:23:13,440 --> 00:23:14,320
Time is tight.

487
00:23:14,800 --> 00:23:15,800
As far as I know,

488
00:23:16,240 --> 00:23:18,640
your troupe is facing financial problems.

489
00:23:19,320 --> 00:23:20,720
Our main purpose here

490
00:23:21,200 --> 00:23:23,880
is to let you know the strength of Hengshu Group.

491
00:23:24,680 --> 00:23:25,920
So when we inform you

492
00:23:25,920 --> 00:23:28,120
that we are going to invest in your musical,

493
00:23:28,120 --> 00:23:29,180
you'll understand

494
00:23:29,720 --> 00:23:30,720
what this means.

495
00:23:32,680 --> 00:23:33,400
Uh,

496
00:23:34,040 --> 00:23:34,720
boss.

497
00:23:35,320 --> 00:23:36,280
Let me ask,

498
00:23:36,480 --> 00:23:37,680
what did you just say?

499
00:23:37,680 --> 00:23:39,040
Can you say it again?

500
00:23:39,120 --> 00:23:40,920
I plan to invest in your musical.

501
00:23:41,320 --> 00:23:42,200
See?

502
00:23:42,200 --> 00:23:42,880
Really?

503
00:23:42,880 --> 00:23:44,800
As long as you make good works,

504
00:23:44,840 --> 00:23:45,760
fate

505
00:23:45,760 --> 00:23:47,000
will favor us.

506
00:23:47,600 --> 00:23:48,120
Mr. Leng,

507
00:23:48,120 --> 00:23:49,080
can we talk in private?

508
00:23:49,080 --> 00:23:49,880
Wait a minute.

509
00:23:51,120 --> 00:23:52,920
Why would a daily necessities group

510
00:23:52,920 --> 00:23:54,480
want to invest in our musical?

511
00:23:54,480 --> 00:23:55,800
Wait a minute.

512
00:23:58,320 --> 00:23:59,560
Are you showing off?

513
00:24:01,160 --> 00:24:01,640
Mr. Leng.

514
00:24:01,640 --> 00:24:02,760
Director Ning,

515
00:24:02,960 --> 00:24:04,960
I think this is a very good question.

516
00:24:06,880 --> 00:24:09,280
The reason I chose to invest in your musical

517
00:24:09,800 --> 00:24:11,060
is because your troupe

518
00:24:11,480 --> 00:24:13,680
has someone who is very important to me.

519
00:24:14,320 --> 00:24:17,120
I will definitely help when he is in trouble.

520
00:24:19,480 --> 00:24:20,920
So for this cooperation,

521
00:24:21,320 --> 00:24:22,120
I also have an

522
00:24:22,920 --> 00:24:24,250
additional condition.

523
00:24:25,120 --> 00:24:26,120
What condition?

524
00:24:26,600 --> 00:24:27,260
Just say it.

525
00:24:27,760 --> 00:24:28,320
Yishu,

526
00:24:28,920 --> 00:24:31,250
come home with me for dinner this weekend.

527
00:24:32,560 --> 00:24:33,280
Yishu?

528
00:24:33,360 --> 00:24:34,000
We don't have this person.

529
00:24:34,000 --> 00:24:34,930
We don't, right?

530
00:24:35,480 --> 00:24:35,920
Yi...

531
00:24:36,120 --> 00:24:36,880
Who is Yishu?

532
00:24:38,480 --> 00:24:39,940
You are not Yishu, are you?

533
00:24:40,040 --> 00:24:41,240
Who is Yishu?

534
00:24:41,360 --> 00:24:42,720
What's the relationship between Yishu and you?

535
00:24:42,720 --> 00:24:44,080
So in the theater troupe,

536
00:24:44,080 --> 00:24:46,410
you've been using your stage name, right?

537
00:24:47,040 --> 00:24:47,760
Jin Xi.

538
00:24:49,200 --> 00:24:50,600
It's him.

539
00:24:50,600 --> 00:24:51,600
What should we do?

540
00:24:55,840 --> 00:24:57,000
What is his real name?
